# Only the website itself goes to GitHub. Everything else in this folder
# (original photos, scans, the "My work" folder, headshots, loose images)
# stays on this computer. To share something new, add it to the list below.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/astro.config.mjs
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/tsconfig.json
!/public/
!/scripts/
!/src/

# Never upload these, even inside the folders above
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
.DS_Store
.env*
